OL,3,GNEWSAMoment mum catches suspected arson
OL,4,Aattack on CCTV
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mum-of-two has said she was
OL,7,F"disgusted" after watching CCTV of an
OL,8,Farson attacker setting fire to her
OL,9,Fhome.
OL,11,FHolly Cham, 33, from Bootle, in
OL,12,FMerseyside, was away with her children
OL,13,Fwhen - in an incident caught on her
OL,14,Fsecurity cameras - a stranger appeared
OL,15,Fto emerge from her garage, coming back
OL,16,Finto view as a fire took hold.
OL,18,FA 31-year-old man was arrested on
OL,19,Fsuspicion of arson with intent to
OL,20,Fendanger life following a fire on 24
OL,21,FAugust, Merseyside Police said.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
